_to","target_id":"1481-d4f3-330c-4dfd"}],"description":"## What\n\nThe base runtime-dependency count and the `mcp` extra's version floor are stated\ninconsistently and incorrectly across docs. Ground truth in `pyproject.toml`\n(`dependencies`, lines ~62-66) is **three** base deps — `pyyaml`, `jsonschema`,\n`referencing` — and the mcp floor (line ~82) is `mcp>=1.9`.\n\nDrift to correct:\n- `README.md:148-151` claims \"only two runtime dependencies\" (names pyyaml +\n  jsonschema, omits `referencing`).\n- `README.md:157` claims the mcp extra needs `mcp>=1.2` (should be `mcp>=1.9`).\n- `docs/config.md:46-48` claims the \"ONLY runtime dependency is `pyyaml`\" and quotes a\n  stale one-element array `[\"pyyaml>=6\"]`.\n- `pyproject.toml:~43` carries its own stale \"Two runtime dependencies\" comment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `README.md`, `docs/config.md`, and the `pyproject.toml` comment all state the\n      correct base-dependency set (pyyaml, jsonschema, referencing) consistently.\n- [ ] The mcp extra floor reads `mcp>=1.9` everywhere it is mentioned.\n- [ ] The numbers/version match `pyproject.toml` exactly (verify by re-reading it).\n\nFiles: `README.md` (lines ~148-157), `docs/config.md` (lines ~46-48),\n`pyproject.toml` (comment ~line 43).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"README.md","reason":"dep count + mcp floor ~lines 148-157"},{"path":"docs/config.md","reason":"sole-dependency claim ~lines 46-48"},{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"stale two-deps comment ~line 43"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","4191-b4f9-146a-43cd"],["relates_to","1481-d4f3-330c-4dfd"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"4191-b4f9-146a-43cd","parent_status_uuid":"a5bfb371-6359-4eb1-9b1a-c8c67ef67359","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["docs","p1"],